"GET /v1/limits answers with the same JSON as --probe --json, from the cached readings, for status-line scripts and widgets on this Mac. Loopback only, no authentication; off because it widens the surface of an app whose point is that nothing leaves the Mac." = "GET /v1/limits 從快取讀數回傳與 --probe --json 相同的 JSON，供這台 Mac 上的狀態列指令碼和小工具使用。僅限本機迴路，無需驗證；預設關閉，因為它擴大了一個以「資料不離開 Mac」為宗旨的 App 的暴露面。";
"Gestures: swipe down to open, swipe up to close" = "手勢：向下滑開啟，向上滑關閉";
