"Global: they work from any app. The panel's own keys: Escape closes it, ⌘R refreshes, ⌘, opens Settings, ⌘Q quits." = "全域：在任何 App 中都有效。面板本身的按鍵：Escape 關閉，⌘R 重新整理，⌘, 開啟設定，⌘Q 結束。";
