"Install and sign in to Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI or GitHub Copilot; its meters appear here." = "安裝並登入 Claude Code、Codex、Cursor、Gemini CLI 或 GitHub Copilot，其儀表會顯示在這裡。";
