"Let Claude Code talk to the notch?" = "讓 Claude Code 與瀏海溝通？";
"Let Claude Code tell the notch when it starts, stops or waits for you. The hook passes on the event name, the session id and the folder's name; the meter refreshes at once, the card counts sessions, and a badge shows while Claude waits for your input." = "讓 Claude Code 在開始、停止或等待你時通知瀏海。掛鉤只傳遞事件名稱、工作階段 ID 與檔案夾名稱；儀表會立即重新整理，卡片會計算工作階段數，Claude 等待你輸入時會顯示標記。";
