"Off by default so the menu bar keeps its room; the Options menu is then a right-click on the rings. On, it puts Quit and Settings one click (and VoiceOver's VO-M-M) away, which a Mac without a notch needs." = "預設關閉，以免佔用選單列空間；此時「選項」選單由右鍵點按圓環開啟。開啟後，「結束」與「設定」一按即達（VoiceOver 的 VO-M-M 亦可），沒有瀏海的 Mac 需要它。";
"Offline, retrying" = "離線，正在重試";
"Once per window and reset period: when its pace first reaches on track or behind, and again when it comes within an hour of running out. Each one says what to do about it. macOS asks for permission when this is turned on or the first alert is due, never at launch." = "每個視窗每個重設週期各一次：當進度首次達到剛好夠用或落後時，以及距離用完不到一小時時再提醒一次。每則通知都會說明該怎麼做。macOS 會在開啟此項或第一則提醒到期時詢問權限，不會在啟動時詢問。";
"One entry in ~/.claude/settings.json makes Claude Code run %@ --hook when a session starts, a turn ends or it waits for you: the meter refreshes at once, the card counts sessions, and a dot shows while Claude waits. The file is backed up first, and you can remove it any time from this section." = "在 ~/.claude/settings.json 加入一個項目，Claude Code 便會在工作階段開始、一輪結束或等待你時執行 %@ --hook：儀表會立即重新整理，卡片會計算工作階段數，Claude 等待時會顯示圓點。檔案會先備份，你隨時可在本節移除它。";
"Only turns longer than" = "僅限時長超過";
