"Running from here, Open at login and updates cannot work. The app is copied to /Applications, relaunched from there, and this copy is moved to the Trash." = "從目前位置執行時，「登入時開啟」與更新都無法運作。App 會被拷貝到 /Applications 並從那裡重新啟動，目前這份副本會移到垃圾桶。";
