"Set this as statusLine in %1$@, or use Install status line… to have it written for you. Claude Code runs %2$@ --statusline after every turn; it forwards the context fill, the rate limits and the session cost to the app and prints one line for Claude Code's own bar." = "將此設為 %1$@ 中的 statusLine，或使用「安裝狀態列…」自動寫入。Claude Code 會在每一輪結束後執行 %2$@ --statusline；它把上下文佔用、速率限制與本工作階段花費轉送給 App，並為 Claude Code 自己的狀態列輸出一行。";
