"Synced Claude Code logs from another Mac, or any folder of transcripts: a projects folder or a flat folder of session folders both work. Claude Desktop's Cowork sessions are read automatically when present. The rate-limit meters are account-wide already; this only widens the cost card." = "從另一台 Mac 同步的 Claude Code 記錄，或任何記錄檔案夾：projects 檔案夾或工作階段檔案夾的平面目錄皆可。Claude Desktop 的 Cowork 工作階段存在時會自動讀取。速率限制儀表本就以帳號為單位；此項只擴大花費卡片的範圍。";
"Tells you what to do, not just how much." = "不只告訴你用了多少，還告訴你該怎麼做。";
"The login item points at a copy of the app that has moved. Turn it off and on again." = "登入項目指向的 App 副本已被移動。請關閉後再重新開啟。";
"The rings shrink to a dot once no assistant has been active for 30 minutes and every window is quiet; a hook event, file activity, a pace change or resting the pointer on them brings them back." = "當 30 分鐘內沒有助理活動且所有視窗都很安靜時，圓環會縮成一個圓點；掛鉤事件、檔案活動、進度變化或把游標停在上面都會讓它們恢復。";
